WEBVTT

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:59.310
Kinda chilly down here.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:02.000
Well, we are dressed like this underground...

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.570
You're doing okay, Suu-chan?

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:07.380
Yes. This isn't cold enough to bother me.

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:09.860
Really? Well, good.

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:15.020
This is definitely the way 
to go when it's cold.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:17.800
H-Hey, Nozomi-chan...

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.820
What if something jumps out at us?

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.830
Oh, something will.
From around the next corner.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:25.030
Jeez, cut that out.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.290
Uh...

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:37.050
See? There it is.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:40.490
It's coming this way!

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:42.350
Yeah, because you keep screaming.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.910
Stay behind us, Sassu-Sassu.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:45.820
Okay.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.570
Hime, use your bow.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:53.090
Huh? But won't that make the
Animal Welfare people angry?

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:55.310
You'll be fine. Just look at its face.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:57.850
See? It's human.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:02:59.640
They won't get mad if you shoot a human.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.520
That doesn't seem right, somehow...

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.160
Here it comes!

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:08.980
It dodged that?!

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.620
I'm sorry!

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.960
Here we go!

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:22.050
Kyoko, make with the magic!

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.630
I know.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:25.350
Doing it now.

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:27.790
There.

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:37.930
Dora magura, goma magura, sesame magura...

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.930
Kyoko, what's the holdup?!

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.860
Hooray, hooray!

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:48.940
Hooray, hooray!

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:51.440
Sassu-Sassu, what are you doing?

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.100
A victory dance.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.870
Is it helping?

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:56.470
Well, it's distracting me.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.980
Upsy-daisy.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.810
Okay, here goes.

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:07.330
Burn, flame!

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.170
Step back, everyone.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.000
Is this gonna work?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.750
Step back, Nozomi.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.320
Nice one!

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:35.380
I know.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:46.250
Only two gold? Stingy.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:50.000
No, no. You've been influenced 
by the real world too much.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.970
If it had money, doesn't that mean 
it was an intelligent being?

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.110
It didn't look like one to me.

00:04:57.110 --> 00:05:01.420
It's probably like how crows 
collect shiny things.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.990
I mean, it's really just a monster, isn't it?

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.100
What?!

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:08.090
Which means this labyrinth 
is a haunted house.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.350
A slightly active one.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.580
I don't do so well in haunted houses...

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.710
Only because you have a bad memory

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.500
of getting spooked and breaking 
something with your butt, right?

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:19.830
How did you know?

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:20.820
Oh, you know.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.910
All right, let's keep moving.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.860
Looks like more of them.

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:40.140
Hime, you can shoot these guys, right?

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:40.950
Yeah.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.830
Kyoko, magic!

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.070
I know.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.680
Kyoko, where's that magic?

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:06.440
Just hang on. Let me see...

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:11.850
Let me handle this one.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.500
We don't need another dance!

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:29.040
Hang on... What was that?

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:32.120
A sutra in the language of the gods.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.720
Aren't you a dancer?

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.030
I'm a priestess.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.780
For what god?

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.010
I'm not sure...

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:43.570
Only one silver?

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:46.210
There are two more. Here.

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:47.940
Wow...

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.730
There's really no one down here, huh?

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.790
We should be pretty far down by now...

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.030
I wouldn't want to see 
anyone looking like this!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:59.970
It's just like being at the pool.

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:01.810
Outside of that,
 you'd be a pervert, though.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.860
I wish I had your outfit, Kyoko-chan.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.020
The cape?

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:10.170
You just didn't think that through when 
we chose our jobs in the beginning.

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:14.480
Well, the mage's incantations 
seemed kinda hard.

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.810
I figured a bow was
 something I could handle.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.130
Nah, it's not that hard.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:21.820
Kyoko can barely use her magic, either.

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:23.450
I beat that troll earlier, didn't I?

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:25.870
What's wrong?

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:28.000
I stepped in something.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.420
What is this stuff?!

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.750
Oh, no... I feel...

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.350
Kyoko! Use your magic to do something!

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:57.850
Let's see...

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:58.980
Hurry it up!

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.110
I think you're fine, actually.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:03.280
How is this fine?!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:05.710
Well, it doesn't look like 
it'll eat you or anything.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:06.950
It won't?

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:09.000
Who cares?! Just do something!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.750
There's nothing to worry about.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:15.290
It'll just do sexy things to you 
and put you in sexy positions for a while.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.890
Hurry up and save us!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:18.760
My armor...

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.240
It's melting!

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:22.300
Kyo-chan, please!

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:27.200
But if I use stuff like fire or ice,
 it'll hit you guys, too.

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:28.770
What can I do?

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.200
How about salt water?

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:34.150
If this is a giant amoeba, 
the osmotic pressure should...

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.500
That sounds pretty scientific, 
but I guess I'll try.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.310
One sec.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.430
Hurry! Hurry!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.040
Who said you could touch in there?!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.610
I can't...

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.240
Stop!

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.840
There, that should do it.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.050
Here goes.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.850
Piassa, selassa, regomar!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.550
Splash and soak!

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:20.020
Well, that's a pretty sexy sight.

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.670
I'm so embarrassed...

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:25.590
I'm not gonna forget this!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.750
<b>Personnel
 Only!!</b>

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:31.750
All right, time to fight the final boss!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:36.760
<b>Personnel 
Only!!</b>

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:34.130
That seems kinda lazy.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.760
It's fine. Let's go.

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:40.640
'Scuse us...

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:47.390
I'm impressed you made it this far.

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:55.710
I am the queen of this labyrinth.

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.230
That's way too damn fitting.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:03.950
The "queen" in which sense?

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.140
Which sense?

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.210
<i>That</i> kind of queen?

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.360
<i>That</i> kind?

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.280
Quiet!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:09.950
Now, listen!

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:14.480
Mere combat skills and magic 
won't be enough to defeat me.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:18.390
You have to figure out the queen's secret,

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.510
or you can't conquer the labyrinth.

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:26.890
If you give the wrong answer,

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:30.890
you'll be trapped here 
for the rest of your lives!

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:37.520
Is your secret...

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.890
that you pad your chest?

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.450
H-How did you...?

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:51.380
Please. That's obvious.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.520
Hey! Hold up!

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.570
Oh, crap!

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:07.620
Run!

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:09.740
Wait for me!

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:20.640
You just wrote this 
as an inside joke, didn't you?

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.360
Huh?

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:23.220
Does it seem that way?

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:25.910
I like adventure stories, personally.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:26.940
Me, too.

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:29.790
I could point out a lot 
of problems with it, though.

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:33.310
For one thing, what good 
is bikini armor gonna do?

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.390
Good point...

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:46.930
<b>We Tried Making a Fantasy 
Story in RPG Style.</b>

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:44.490
Hey, what are you looking at?

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:51.940
<b>Fierce Fights! Arm Wrestling! 
How Will the Battle of the Heroines End?</b>

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:04.450
<b>Inukai | Katsura | Shima | Naraku | Aiko | Sassu-Sassu | Hime | Higashitetsu | Akechi</b>

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:04.450
<b>Mitama | Omaki | Sato | Kogata | Shimoike | Kojima | Kohina | Gokuraku (Nozomi) | Gokuraku (Akira)</b>

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:13.770
Um... What's everyone doing?

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:16.920
Ah, the favorite is here.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:25.380
Okay, here we go.

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.300
Ready...

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:28.750
Begin!

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:34.180
Sorry, but I build these muscles every day.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.760
I won't lose to someone 
who's not even in a club!

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:42.050
And the class president wins.

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.160
Man, that hurt...

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:47.030
How are you so strong?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.420
I build muscles in a
different way every day.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.120
I get it.

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:00.230
Okay, next.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:02.360
Remember, no cheating.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.180
<b>Inukai           Katsura</b>

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.380
Arm wrestling is about 
reading your opponent.

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.710
Watch her closely.

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:18.190
Okay, I will.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.910
<i>Watch her closely...</i>

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.620
<i>Oh, man, she's staring at me...</i>

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.960
Stare...

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:36.870
Are you ready?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.530
Hakkeyoi!

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:39.410
Nokotta!

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:49.860
Aiko-chan wins.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.050
I lost.

00:13:58.050 --> 00:13:59.640
Jeez...

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:01.940
You're up next, Hime.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:02.900
Right...

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.900
<b>Aiko          Sassu-Sassu</b>

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:12.100
<i>Why is everyone taking this so seriously?</i>

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:15.380
Okay, grab hands.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.340
I bet it'll be Princess.

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:19.180
Fuku-chan's tough, too.

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:22.210
She's one of the top five
 in the prefecture in shot put.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:26.600
<i>Her hands are bigger than I thought...</i>

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.400
Are you ready?

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.850
Hakkeyoi!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.600
Nokotta!

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:42.100
Check out Hime. 
She's got the strength of a gorilla.

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:48.440
There!

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:55.200
Aw, I lost!

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.030
Huh?

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.640
That one didn't count.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.750
Come on! Take this seriously!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.760
But I am...

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:11.230
If Hime loses, we'll all take turns 
verifying whether or not her breasts are real.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:12.750
Verifying?

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:17.390
I mean directly of course, little lady!

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:20.440
What? But they <i>are</i> real!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.390
Okay, let's start again.

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:24.280
Ready?

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:26.280
Hakkeyoi!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.140
Nokotta!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.950
Princess wins!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.420
Are you okay?

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:36.150
I lost... After all that training...

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:37.970
A promise is a promise.

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:39.520
Do as you will.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.660
You don't have to take your clothes off!

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:44.900
You weren't part of the bet.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.300
Oh...

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.090
Jeez...

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:53.800
You were supposed to be a match for me?
 You're so weak.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.190
So are... you!

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:03.180
You know, Akira... You have good reflexes,

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:05.180
but you have no muscle strength at all.

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:07.670
You should at least help 
your mom out sometimes.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:10.120
Shut up, you savage!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.560
Hup!

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.330
The kendo club member lost!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.110
And the tea club member won!

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.120
<b>Shimoike                       Kojima</b>

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.630
<b>Hime              Higashitetsu</b>

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.630
<b>Sato                     Kogata</b>

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.880
Whew, I'm tired.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:34.400
So why are we arm wrestling, anyway?

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.770
Come on, Princess! You're up next!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:39.890
Go get 'em.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:45.350
<b>Hime            Higashitetsu</b>

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:46.770
Hi-yah!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.580
Nozomi-chan wins!

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:50.680
Yes!

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.770
I lost.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:57.150
But you two look the same, 
so I guess it's okay.

00:16:57.150 --> 00:17:00.580
This is dumb. Who cares about 
contests of strength?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.580
<b>Gokuraku (Nozomi) 
    Gokuraku (Akira)</b>

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.800
<b>Inukai</b>

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.800
<b>Hime</b>

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.800
<b>Mitama</b>

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.800
<b>Gokuraku
 (Nozomi)</b>

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:17.240
Okay, we've got our best four!

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.140
That's my Michi!

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:21.180
No favoritism allowed.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:24.940
I've known you for many years,

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.850
but it seems the time has 
come to settle the score.

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:32.520
You always get so serious 
when it comes to contests.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.710
Got anything?

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:37.850
Why are we arm wrestling?

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:45.110
I'm surprised no one's left
 from any of the athletic teams.

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:49.370
Well, Hime and Nozomi
 are involved with local dojos.

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:52.640
No false starting, okay?

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:55.380
Ready...

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:57.030
Go!

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:09.970
For a game, you're taking 
this pretty seriously.

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:13.980
Well, I love competition, too.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.620
The winner is Mitama!

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:41.300
For real?

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:43.570
Also, you take this way too seriously.

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:46.350
We build up our bodies in different ways.

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:50.010
So child-raising beats karate, huh?

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:52.770
Nothing's stronger than a mother,
 as they say.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.290
She's not a mother, though.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.780
Okay, Inukaicchi and Princess are next.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.110
Oh... Right.

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:06.820
I'm sure it won't even be a contest.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.700
You think so?

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:11.290
I know about Princess,

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:14.290
but how is Inukai so strong?

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:18.500
Well, she's tall, and she was 
into sports in middle school.

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:21.890
Actually, it's love.

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:23.850
Love?

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.850
You're not gonna say it's because

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:30.730
you guys get cozy ekiben
style every day, are you?

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:34.490
Ekiben? Like, selling train station
bento boxes in train cars part-time?

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:36.310
Good guess!

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.500
And you're so dirty.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.650
You just have a dirty mind.

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.690
Don't believe her.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.660
Ready?

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:48.630
Hakkeyoi!

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:49.490
Nokotta!

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:53.280
Princess wins.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.590
You really are strong.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.580
A-Are you okay?

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.860
Your love lost.

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.800
Maybe I didn't go about it the right way...

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.600
Take it too far and you'll just look dumb.

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:16.820
Time for the final round!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:18.820
<b>Final Round</b>

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:21.060
Need a break?

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:23.410
I'm totally fine.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.850
Anyway, why are we arm wrestling?

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:29.760
Just so you know, I won't lose, 
even if it is just a game.

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:32.960
Tama-chan, you sound kind of scary.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.700
Are you both ready?

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.920
Hakkeyoi!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:38.970
Nokotta!

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:18.820
I guess no one can beat Hime.

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:20.180
I guess.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.330
Tama-chan, are you okay?

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:28.770
I feel like my little sisters lost.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:33.860
Well, but you know... 
I carry Shino-chan around a lot, too.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:37.560
I think she weighs three times 
as much as the Chi-chans.

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:44.280
Now I have an idea of how much you weigh.

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:48.460
D-Don't tell anyone!
 I mean that, Tama-chan!

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:50.070
Okay?!

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:52.080
You can't tell anyone!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:54.080
<b>Hime</b>

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:54.080
<b>Mitama</b>

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:54.080
<b>Winner 
Heroine</b>

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:54.080
<b>Hime, of course!!</b>

00:21:54.080 --> 00:22:01.960
<b>Winner 
Heroine</b>

00:21:54.080 --> 00:22:01.960
<b>Hime, of course!!</b>

